{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 10150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8510, "text": "Okay, who's got my headlines?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 12130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10930, "text": "You looking for this, Mac?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 15870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13770, "text": "Brian Boss Faces Big House."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 20090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16210, "text": "Yep, another front -page headline for\nMargaret. I'm telling you, with the"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 23890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 20090, "text": "she's dug up this year, they're gonna be\nable to put away Al Little Puffball's"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 25290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23890, "text": "Vecchione for life."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 27550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26190, "text": "You saving her clipping?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 28830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 27830, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 32549, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28990, "text": "Someday we'll cuddle up next to a\nroaring fire and we'll have these warm,"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 34150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32610, "text": "wonderful memories to share."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 36790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35170, "text": "Mob boss blown to bits."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 41650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39690, "text": "Hitman decapitated in vicious attack."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 46150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43850, "text": "Mobster's leg found in chopped salad."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 50130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48210, "text": "Is that a headline or a recipe?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 53810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51750, "text": "Hey, is this a great night or what?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 55990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54310, "text": "You seem to be in good spirits."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 61300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56800, "text": "And why shouldn't I be? I'm a living,\nbreathing human being. I love me. I love"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 62980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61300, "text": "you. I love everybody."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 68060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66040, "text": "Great. Let's check into the Waldorf, my\ntree."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 72160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70420, "text": "I meant that spiritually, Dan."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 75380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72460, "text": "Oh, she's spewing that support group\nbabble again."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 76720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75660, "text": "And why shouldn't I?"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 79720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77320, "text": "Happy, alone, healthy adults is more\nthan just support."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 81600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80020, "text": "Ha -ha is a way of life."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 88350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85230, "text": "To celebrate my brand new freewheeling\nlifestyle, I've decided to throw a hey,"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 89770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 88350, "text": "I'm back and I'm okay party."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 92270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90250, "text": "Tonight. Completely spontaneously."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 95090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93510, "text": "Okay, here's your party assignments."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 98750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 97030, "text": "I printed them out on my home computer."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 102390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99490, "text": "Gee, it's not often you get a really\nspontaneous printout."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 105410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 103710, "text": "Mac, you and Conley can bring the hors d\n'oeuvres."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 106670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105670, "text": "Anything you like."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 108990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 106970, "text": "Although this rumaki recipe never fails."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 113430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110350, "text": "Jack, spontaneous rumaki coming right\nup."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 117660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115920, "text": "Bull, I thought you could be in charge\nof the music."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 119018, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 118180, "text": "Oh, terrific."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 120900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 119020, "text": "I haven't played my ocarina in years."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 125240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122580, "text": "Well, I was thinking more along the\nlines of a cassette deck and tapes."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 128000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 127000, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 132520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 130620, "text": "And, Dan, I thought... Sorry, can't make\nit."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 137080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 133600, "text": "I'm up to my neck in paperwork for the\nPhil Foundation. I have to feed the"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 138300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 137300, "text": "remember?"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 141340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138700, "text": "Well, okay, but this completely throws\noff my plans."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 143120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 142120, "text": "What's my assignment?"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 144960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 143560, "text": "Roz, I thought you could guard the coat."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 152020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 150360, "text": "Finally, my life has meaning."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 156180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 153820, "text": "Why would we want to steal each other's\ncoats?"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 160300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 157000, "text": "Well, I'm inviting a few other people.\nI'm including my support group."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 161880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160700, "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 167000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 162480, "text": "A whole group of single, desperate,\nlonely women?"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 170620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 169520, "text": "My kind of party."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 173160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 172160, "text": "I'll bring the oysters."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 178100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 176880, "text": "What about the poor, Dan?"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 179620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178380, "text": "Let them find their own women."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 224920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223820, "text": "All right, Matt, what's next?"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 227120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225280, "text": "People versus Yolanda Wells."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 229840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228020, "text": "Solicitation. Hi, Yolanda."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 231620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 230180, "text": "What's your story this time?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 233159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232200, "text": "I'm innocent."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 234240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233160, "text": "I wasn't soliciting."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 236240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234860, "text": "I merely asked."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 238320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236780, "text": "Hey, Your Honor, it was entrapment."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 242380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238560, "text": "Not true, Your Honor. This arrest was\ntotally by the book. Oh, I beg to"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 245720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242560, "text": "The arresting officer neglected to\nidentify himself or show his badge."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 252300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248220, "text": "I think he wants to hear more testimony."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 256360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 253680, "text": "No, no, no, no, no. I know what he's\ndoing. Uh, two words."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 257640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256640, "text": "First syllable."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 260740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259740, "text": "I don't get it."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 261959, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 260959, "text": "I do."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 263880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262180, "text": "Two words. First syllable."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 265120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264120, "text": "Dr. Zhivago!"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 267920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266920, "text": "Who's that?"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 269220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268220, "text": "Your Honor."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 272060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269440, "text": "Miss Wells. Ah, yeah. Yolanda, let's\nmake it the regular."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 277180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272320, "text": "$100 and time served. And might I\nsuggest that you consider the joys and"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 279540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277180, "text": "of a loving, monogamous relationship."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 282970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280710, "text": "Monogamous? No, that's Latin for almost\ndead."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 286830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284910, "text": "And what do you say we take a little\nbreak, people?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 296670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294570, "text": "Well, this happiness is depressing me."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 301030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 297330, "text": "Harry's so happy to have somebody, it\nrevolts me. You're so happy not to have"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 302470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301030, "text": "somebody, it disgusts me."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 304670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303370, "text": "I've got a girlfriend, too."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 306630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305390, "text": "You know what that makes me?"}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 309150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307670, "text": "A candidate for neutering."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 317830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 314990, "text": "Harry, I love you so much. Let's go home\nright now. We need to spend some time"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 319950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317830, "text": "together. Oh, sweetheart, court's still\nin session."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 323710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 321370, "text": "I suppose I could stall for 15 minutes."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 327050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324850, "text": "I've always wondered if this couch folds\nout."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 330010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328450, "text": "I mean, I need to talk to you."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 331910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330910, "text": "It's important."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 334210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332710, "text": "Okay, I got a few minutes."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 336090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335090, "text": "What's up?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 337830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 336690, "text": "Oh, this is hard to say."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 341670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339770, "text": "Harry, I feel so close to you."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 346200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342760, "text": "I think about the future, and I know\nwe'll feel the same way about so many"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 347740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346200, "text": "things for the rest of our lives."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 350420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348600, "text": "Margaret, whatever it is, you can tell\nme."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 352840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351840, "text": "Or show me."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 355740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354740, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 359940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356600, "text": "What I'm trying to really say is that\nI... Hey, here. Can I talk to you a"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 360940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 359940, "text": "minute?"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 366060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362240, "text": "Can you see you're interrupting?"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 369000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367760, "text": "It's no big deal. Nobody's naked."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 374320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373320, "text": "Look, I need some legal advice."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 379620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 374860, "text": "Do you think giving $5 ,000 to a needy\nbut statuesque woman could count as a"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 380780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379620, "text": "donation from the Phil Foundation?"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 385240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382300, "text": "I don't know, Dan. Does she have a trust\nor a fund or something? Oh, yeah, yeah,"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 387780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385260, "text": "yeah. It's called Purchase a Porsche for\nPatricia Group."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 390940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389660, "text": "I don't think so, Dan."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 392660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 391660, "text": "She's an orphan."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 398560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393800, "text": "Harry. Honey, court will be done in an\nhour. Christine's having a party"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 399640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398640, "text": "I'll pick you up. We'll go together."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 401400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 399860, "text": "I'll have to meet you there. I have an\nappointment."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 403000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 402000, "text": "With who?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 404320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403280, "text": "My family minister."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 405760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404760, "text": "I'll see you later."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 412260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408620, "text": "What was that all about? She comes in\nhere telling me how much she loves me"}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 416180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412260, "text": "how much we have in common and starts\ntalking about our life together and now"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 421860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416180, "text": "she runs off to... She runs off to talk\nto the family minister?"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 424340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423340, "text": "So?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 431100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426660, "text": "Dan, before you barge in, I think\nMargaret was..."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 433540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432040, "text": "You're going to ask me to marry her."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 437980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436640, "text": "Then you owe me big."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 444880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442900, "text": "Talk about dodging the bullet."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 447760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446760, "text": "Here, wait, wait, wait."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 450740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447980, "text": "Simple solution. You avoid her for the\nrest of your life, you're off the hook."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 454320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453140, "text": "What if I want to be hooked?"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 456900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 455900, "text": "Stone, wait."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 459560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458560, "text": "Are you nuts?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 463120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460000, "text": "Think about it. The same woman for the\nrest of your life."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 465320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463760, "text": "What if you live more than a week?"}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 468680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467560, "text": "Hey, guys, what's going on?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 471900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469360, "text": "Margaret's just gone off to talk to her\nfamily minister about marriage."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 476440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472600, "text": "Harry thinks she's going to pop the\nquestion. I cannot convince him to flee"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 477440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476440, "text": "seek sanctuary."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 482380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477860, "text": "Well, congratulations, sir. Don't\nencourage him."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 487700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482920, "text": "Hey, a good marriage is one of life's\ngreat joys. For sure."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 493160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489080, "text": "Yeah, look at me and Kwan Lee. It's been\nsix years, and I have never been so"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 499900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493160, "text": "happy. He's never been so tied down, so\nchained, handcuffed to one"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 500900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 499900, "text": "woman."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 503510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501610, "text": "Wait a minute, I'm making this sound\nlike too much fun."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 506950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505550, "text": "Harry! Harry!"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 508670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507670, "text": "Everything okay?"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 510170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508870, "text": "Everything is terrible."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 513690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510650, "text": "Everything's great. Harry thinks\nMargaret's gonna pop the question."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 516950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515530, "text": "Whoa, kind of sudden."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 519650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517909, "text": "It's also kind of wonderful."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 522230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519870, "text": "Wow, now we have something to celebrate\ntonight."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 525430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523750, "text": "I don't know if I'm ready for this."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 527350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525910, "text": "It's an awfully big step."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 529010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528010, "text": "Do you love her?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 531690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530670, "text": "Yeah, I love her."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 533470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532430, "text": "Yeah, I love her."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 539050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535870, "text": "And you love it when she grills you from\ncoming home late at night, huh? And you"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 542230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 539050, "text": "love the holidays when her family\ninvades your home."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 544470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 542770, "text": "Would you think, man? This is insane."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 548650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545610, "text": "Hey, Roz, Margaret's gonna ask Harry to\nmarry her. How about that?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 551350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549510, "text": "As long as I don't have to be a\nbridesmaid."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 553890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 552870, "text": "I hate taffeta."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 559030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558030, "text": "Hi, everybody."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 560050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559050, "text": "What's up?"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 562210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560090, "text": "Well, Margaret went to see her family\nminister."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 564430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562490, "text": "Harry thinks she's going to pop the\nquestion."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 566190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 565190, "text": "Oh, no!"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 569150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567030, "text": "What's Harry going to do if Margaret\nmarries her minister?"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 573510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 571310, "text": "Hey, congratulations, Judge Harry."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 574569, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573790, "text": "Thank you, Jack."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 577590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574570, "text": "It's like the song says, love is always\nbetter the second time around."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 580350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 578670, "text": "It's his first marriage, Jack."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 581630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580630, "text": "It is?"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 583070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582070, "text": "Uh -oh."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 587470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585190, "text": "Listen to the blind man. He makes sense."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 590380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589040, "text": "You gotta listen to your heart, sir."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 593460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590860, "text": "I wish I could, Jack, but it's pounding\nso hard."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 595400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594080, "text": "I don't know why I'm so scared."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 600420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 596140, "text": "This may sound dumb, but to me, being\nmarried means there will always be a"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 601960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600420, "text": "surprise in your refrigerator."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 606700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604520, "text": "Like your mother -in -law's teeth."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 613140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610340, "text": "I don't care. I want a surprise in my\nrefrigerator."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 615520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613640, "text": "And I want Margaret in my life."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 617640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 615920, "text": "If she asks, I'm gonna say yes."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 619770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618730, "text": "I want to get married."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 625650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625090, "text": "The"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 635030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625650, "text": "other"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 638130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 635030, "text": "gentlemen are wearing sports jackets."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 641090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 638570, "text": "Why didn't you wear that sports jacket I\nbought you?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 643530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641630, "text": "You got me a ski jacket."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 646870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645710, "text": "Skiing is a sport."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 651600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650600, "text": "Are you happy?"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 653000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651800, "text": "I'm happy."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 655940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653220, "text": "I'm happy. Are you happy? Oh, I'm happy."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 658080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657080, "text": "I'm happy."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 660460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659080, "text": "Hi, happy. I'm horny."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 670900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669760, "text": "Excuse me?"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 673320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671460, "text": "So, what brings you here tonight?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 677260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674160, "text": "I always go for group activities."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 683410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680430, "text": "What do you say we get together and make\nour own private little group tomorrow"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 688650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683410, "text": "night? Oh, I'd love to, but tomorrow's\nmy aerobics for lovers class."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 691430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690430, "text": "Do tell."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 698970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693190, "text": "You know, since my wife dumped me, I've\nbecome a student of people. I can tell a"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 700830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698970, "text": "lot about a person just by their body\nlanguage."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 705170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701930, "text": "Looking at you, I can tell that you're a\nvery angry woman."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 713640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 711340, "text": "you're repressing an enormous amount of\nrage."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 719800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 716180, "text": "Repressing my rage is the only thing\nkeeping you out of traction right now."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 722800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721780, "text": "Thanks for sharing that."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 724680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723680, "text": "I'm still happy."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 725880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724720, "text": "And stay away from mouth coats."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 731260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728780, "text": "I'm sorry, Christina, I can't get this\ntape out. It's stuck."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 733580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731940, "text": "Oh, come on, Bull. You've just got to\nget it going."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 737260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733940, "text": "I've planned an hour and 17 minutes of\nspontaneous dancing."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 740520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739520, "text": "How about Thursday?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 742890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741890, "text": "Another class."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 746610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743470, "text": "How to make love to a real man."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 751650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749590, "text": "Oh, my God, don't skip that. Not on my\naccount."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 755170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 752930, "text": "How about the night after? Oh, no."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 759390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755630, "text": "That's my acting out your sexual\nfantasies improv group."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 765790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764530, "text": "Look, here, here."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 767390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 766050, "text": "There's an empty hour."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 768770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767770, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 773030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771850, "text": "Just to you."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 775050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773970, "text": "It's a date."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 778910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775410, "text": "But don't you be mad at me if I'm just a\nlittle bit late."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 782410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 779690, "text": "Don't be late. I need that whole hour."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 788770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 783250, "text": "I'll try, Danny. But I have a date just\nbefore you with my parole officer."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 793090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791730, "text": "Your parole officer?"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 797010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793490, "text": "Oh, I have a teensy problem with\nrejection."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 801300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797900, "text": "Oh, my goodness, who could reject you?"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 802580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801580, "text": "My last boyfriend."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 807520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802880, "text": "It really upset me. It also upset my\nteensy little pistol."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 814240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810660, "text": "Oh, you didn't, you didn't, you didn't.\nIt was only a flesh wound."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 817360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814480, "text": "But that won't happen to us, will it,\nDanny?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 818960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817780, "text": "No, of course not."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 821040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 819240, "text": "Oh, oh, oh, oh."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 822700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821460, "text": "What was I thinking?"}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 823940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822940, "text": "I'm gay."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 833700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832700, "text": "Okay,"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 838340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837300, "text": "I think I got it now."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 848060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 846300, "text": "Bull, we can't dance to this."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 850180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848680, "text": "You can if you dance real slow."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 853720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852260, "text": "Hi, guys. Hey, Harry."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 854980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853980, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 858420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 856680, "text": "Save the applause for the wedding night."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 860560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858640, "text": "Thought that would just happen you\ndidn't bring any magic tricks."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 864390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863210, "text": "Jack told me the good news."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 866430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864650, "text": "Being married is wonderful."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 870150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866910, "text": "I'm looking forward to it, but I gotta\nadmit, I'm a little nervous. Oh, hey,"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 875610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870250, "text": "don't you worry, sir. Just remember, the\nsecret of a good marriage now is"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 878970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 875610, "text": "honesty. No, the secret is mystery."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 880410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879410, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 887050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 884170, "text": "How can you be mysterious and totally\nhonest?"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 889770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887810, "text": "You have honest mysteries."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 894120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 893040, "text": "What kind of nonsense is that?"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 895640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894360, "text": "You called that nonsense?"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 897120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896120, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 899280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 897180, "text": "Thanks for all the advice, guys."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 902020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901020, "text": "Hi, Harry."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 903679, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 902680, "text": "Hi, Bo."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 905420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903680, "text": "So, where will you be honeymooning?"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 908200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905840, "text": "Well, we haven't really figured that\npart out yet, big guy."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 913120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908680, "text": "Well, if I may be so bold, I know a\ngreat out -of -the -way place just"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 914340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913120, "text": "of Paris, France."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 917440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915140, "text": "It'll be perfect for you and the little\nmissus."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 922020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920680, "text": "Marcel's Dude Ranch."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 924900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923900, "text": "Yeah, it's great."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 926760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925260, "text": "It's just like Texas there."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 930320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927800, "text": "Thanks, Bull. I'll run it by the little\nmissus."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 932440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931440, "text": "Oh, and sir?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 936580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 932520, "text": "Yeah? May your first child be a\nmasculine child."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 943560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940660, "text": "Keep it up, Bull, and you'll sleep with\nthe fishes."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 946620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945620, "text": "Harry?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 948300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947300, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 953010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948829, "text": "Now, you know that I think you're making\nthe greatest mistake of your entire"}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 957670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953010, "text": "life, but you are my best friend, so I\nhope that you won't be nearly as"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 959110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957670, "text": "miserable as I think you'll be."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 962850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960570, "text": "Why don't you save that for the best man\ntoast?"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 965510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964510, "text": "Harry?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 969970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966410, "text": "I hold in my hand the one true secret to\na happy marriage."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 974790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973390, "text": "Is that what I think it is?"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 977130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 975010, "text": "Exactly. A prenuptial agreement."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 984780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980240, "text": "Dan, divorce is the last thing on my\nmind right now. Now, I know that may"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 989860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984780, "text": "sense legally, but to me, a prenuptial\nagreement anticipates the worst. It"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 994280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989860, "text": "destroys all the love and the passion.\nIt ruins the spontaneity."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 996940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994580, "text": "No, no, no. You're still confusing this\nwith a condom."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1012699, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011699, "text": "Hi. Hi."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1018800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013520, "text": "I am so glad... I want to show you\nsomething."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1024260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022540, "text": "I never bought one of these before."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1027119, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025720, "text": "You think Margaret will like it?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1030599, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029599, "text": "Harry, it's beautiful."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1036740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1035619, "text": "Big changes, huh?"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1040640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038319, "text": "You know, I never did get the chance to\ntell you how I really feel."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1044700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041579, "text": "I am so happy for you and Margaret."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1052140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045480, "text": "You both have everything that Tony and I\ndidn't. And I just think that... Well,"}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1055000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052340, "text": "Margaret is a very lucky woman."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1056940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055940, "text": "I'm a lucky guy."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1062000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058140, "text": "Not just to have Margaret, but to have\nfriends like you."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1067100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066100, "text": "You know, it's funny."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1069130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067470, "text": "In a way, this is our chance to start\nover."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1071230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069730, "text": "You with Margaret and me alone."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1076430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074070, "text": "I guess this really is the first day of\nthe rest of our lives."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1078610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077110, "text": "Well, not our lives."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1081690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079210, "text": "Together. You know, separate lives."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1087590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086590, "text": "She's here."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1088970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087970, "text": "Good luck."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1092250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090770, "text": "Well, congratulations."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1094670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093670, "text": "Gee, thanks."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1097090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095250, "text": "I'll bet you're floating on air."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1099190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098190, "text": "Not exactly."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1101430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100210, "text": "You want me to watch that coat?"}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1106490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105490, "text": "No, thanks."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1110210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1106950, "text": "Just want to say that if someone has to\nruin Harry's life, I'm glad it's you."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1113390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112390, "text": "Thanks, I think."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1115630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113770, "text": "Margaret, I'm so thrilled for you."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1117770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1116030, "text": "Just think, a brand new life."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1119030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118030, "text": "How did you know?"}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1122330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1119370, "text": "Oh, well, it's kind of hard to keep\nsecrets around here. But listen, if you"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1124050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122330, "text": "anything, don't hesitate to call on me."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1127570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1126570, "text": "Well?"}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1130410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127890, "text": "Harry, I really need to talk to you.\nYeah, I know, I know."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1132610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130990, "text": "Is there someplace quiet we could go?"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1135590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134590, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1139050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137650, "text": "Better get that champagne ready."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1140770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139250, "text": "Yeah, go get that pretty lady."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1145790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144790, "text": "Well?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1149970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147110, "text": "I didn't get a chance to finish what I\nhad to say today in your chambers."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1151550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150550, "text": "I know."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1153330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152330, "text": "I'm all ears."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1155450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154450, "text": "I don't know where to begin."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1158770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157550, "text": "Maybe I can make this easier."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1162110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160210, "text": "I know you're nervous. I'm nervous, too."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1167490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163470, "text": "But I know that what's about to happen\nis absolutely the right thing."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1170110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168670, "text": "And I couldn't be happier."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1175030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171970, "text": "You couldn't be happier I'm going into\nthe witness relocation program?"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1178390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177390, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1184770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181030, "text": "Harry, I've decided to testify before\nthe grand jury in the Vecchione case."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1189300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185130, "text": "What? Without my testimony, he's going\nto walk, and I can't let that happen."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1194300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189500, "text": "And besides, even if I don't testify,\nI'll never be safe again. I know too"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1198560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195480, "text": "The government's going to give me\nprotection and a new identity."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1201440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200120, "text": "I have to go away."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1204200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203200, "text": "When?"}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1209460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204660, "text": "I'll be at a safe house tonight, I\ntestify tomorrow, and then I'll be gone."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1215710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1212270, "text": "I can go with you. No, Harry. I can go\nanywhere. I can go anywhere. If we're"}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1216710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1215710, "text": "together... No, Harry."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1217750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216730, "text": "I've thought of that."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1221870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218930, "text": "You'd be throwing everything away. Your\nlife is here."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1227050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224930, "text": "You won't be alone for long. You'll find\nsomeone."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1230870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229790, "text": "I found someone."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1233410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231830, "text": "Harry, don't make it any harder, okay?"}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1239130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1235750, "text": "And you can't tell anybody, at least not\nfor a couple of weeks. It'd be too"}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1240130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1239130, "text": "dangerous."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1243320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242320, "text": "Miss Turner?"}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1245340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244280, "text": "I'll be there in a minute."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1250500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249180, "text": "I have something for you."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1276560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275560, "text": "for you, too."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1283480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282480, "text": "Oh, my God."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1289800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1285060, "text": "Oh, Harry, no wonder everybody was\ncongratulating me. You thought that..."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1290800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289800, "text": "stupid, huh?"}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1293720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292720, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1297480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1294460, "text": "No, it's not stupid. It's the most\nbeautiful thing I've ever seen."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1318870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1317870, "text": "That's yours."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1331470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1329910, "text": "I would have said yes, you know."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1338890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1337890, "text": "Champagne's all iced."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1341190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340190, "text": "Where's Margaret?"}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1343490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1342490, "text": "She's gone."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1349690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348590, "text": "Things didn't work out."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1354550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353090, "text": "We're not going to see each other\nanymore."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1358910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356090, "text": "Oh, Harry."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1362490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361450, "text": "I'm so sorry."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1371210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364710, "text": "Oh, God. Is there anything I can do or\nanything I can say?"}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1374170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1373070, "text": "I want to go home."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1377730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1376210, "text": "Will you say goodnight for me?"}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1398780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1396520, "text": "One can dance alone in the dark."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1401180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1399080, "text": "Two can make a lifetime through."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1403380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1401540, "text": "She takes two, baby."}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1405600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1404220, "text": "She takes two."}
